{"op":"run","segments":[{"t":100,"u":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0]}],"observe":{"channels":"all","series":false}}

But we need to specify "channels" as "all" or list. The docs say "channels" may be "all". So we can use "all". Also we can request mean/sd over last 20 ticks. t=100 gives enough ticks to settle. Let's do that.

